  "algorithm": [
    "Resolve local refs only; remote refs or cycles fail closed.",
    "Recursively flatten a nested oneOf only when proving an outer arm pair.",
    "Conjunctively collect const/enum literal restrictions, closed object property sets and required properties through allOf and nested property refs.",
    "A direct pair is disjoint only through an empty literal intersection at one common path or a property required by one arm and forbidden by the other closed shape.",
    "A nested pair is disjoint only when every expanded subpair has a direct proof. Unknown or unsupported proof forms fail closed."
